# Hostzilla repo — ignore everything at top level by default, then track only
# the product. Keeps the legacy Pulse app, venv, CyberPanel reference clone,
# databases, backups, logs, and secrets OUT of the repo.
#
# NB: because the default is "ignore everything", every new top-level file or
# directory must be un-ignored here explicitly. LICENSE-adjacent files were
# silently left untracked this way — README linked to CLA.md and COMMERCIAL.md
# that were never actually committed.
/*

# --- track the product ---
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!VERSION
!CLA.md
!COMMERCIAL.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!SECURITY.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!install.sh
!panel/
!runner/
!config/
!docs/
!tests/
!pyproject.toml

# scratch / never-commit inside tracked dirs
panel/venv/
panel/data/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.pyc
*.db
*.sqlite*
.secret_key
.env
*.pem
*.key
